-- Imported by every file in this directory: a rule with no inputs that reads
-- a ledger, `taken now`, beside the reader it calls (smucclaw/l4-ide#1116).

IMPORT prelude

GIVEN dflt IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is taken` dflt MEANS fromMaybe dflt (RECALL OFFICIAL's `taken`)

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`taken now` MEANS `is taken` WITH dflt IS FALSE
